  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">無子，太祖以第十一子<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p001:m0010" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_G">鈞</persName>繼<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p001:m0012" ref="egx_xax_4ic_A">道度</persName>後。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p002:m0000" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_G">鈞</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p002:m0002" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_G">宣禮</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">母<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-wudifive-jun:p003:m0001" ref="p0h_fwp_btz">區貴人</persName>卒，居喪盡禮。</p>
